By way of present appeal, the appellant herein has challenged the judgment dated 24.08.2016 and order on the point of sentence dated 30.08.2016 passed by the then learned ACMM-II, PHC, New Delhi vide which the appellant/accused was held guilty for commission of offences punishable under sections 16(1A) r/w Section 7 of PFA Act, 1954, the appellant was awarded a sentence to undergo Simple Imprisonment for two years as well as to pay fine of Rs. 2,00,000/- for commission of Ajay Kumar Gupta vs Delhi Admn/Food Inspector on 5 March, 2021 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/189032825/
